{"text":"Because one other thing we have in common, Indians and Americans are some of the hardest working people on Earth. And I've seen that in a family here in India. I just want to tell you a quick story. On our last visit here, we visited Humayun's tomb. And while we were there, we met some of the laborers who are the backbone of this nation's progress. We met their children and their families as well, and some wonderful young children with bright smiles, sparks in their eyes. And one of the children we met was a boy named Vishal. And today, Vishal is 16 years old, and he and his family live in South Delhi in the village of Murbun. And his mother works hard in their modest home, and his sister is now in university. She wants to become a teacher.","words":[{"text":"Because","start":1.08,"end":1.48},{"text":"one","start":1.48,"end":1.72},{"text":"other","start":1.72,"end":1.92},{"text":"thing","start":1.92,"end":2.1},{"text":"we","start":2.1,"end":2.22},{"text":"have","start":2.22,"end":2.32},{"text":"in","start":2.32,"end":2.42},{"text":"common","start":2.42,"end":2.62,"punct":","},{"text":"Indians","start":2.74,"end":2.96},{"text":"and","start":2.96,"end":3.08},{"text":"Americans","start":3.08,"end":3.3},{"text":"are","start":3.3,"end":3.5},{"text":"some","start":3.5,"end":3.62},{"text":"of","start":3.62,"end":3.74},{"text":"the","start":3.74,"end":3.78},{"text":"hardest","start":3.78,"end":3.94},{"text":"working","start":3.94,"end":4.3},{"text":"people","start":4.3,"end":4.6},{"text":"on","start":4.6,"end":4.78},{"text":"Earth","start":4.78,"end":4.94,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":5.78,"end":5.9},{"text":"I've","start":5.9,"end":6.12},{"text":"seen","start":6.12,"end":6.3},{"text":"that","start":6.3,"end":6.64},{"text":"in","start":6.64,"end":10.26},{"text":"a","start":10.26,"end":11.98},{"text":"family","start":11.98,"end":12.28},{"text":"here","start":12.28,"end":12.62},{"text":"in","start":12.62,"end":12.74},{"text":"India","start":12.74,"end":13.0,"pun